Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.29,0:04:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第3季第16集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:04.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（走过的路）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.70,0:01:41.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:38.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（地狱之犬）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.60,0:16:04.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（印第安纳州 新哈莫尼）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:12.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（弗里芒家）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.30,0:16:37.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（帮帮我们）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.07,0:25:13.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（待售）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.97,0:00:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 你要拿自己的灵魂换吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess, you're offering up your own soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要复活萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you gotta do is bring Sam back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}One year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.39,0:00:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上解除迪恩的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Dean out of his deal right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.18,0:00:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也像其他人一样有老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a boss like everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,合同在谁手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who holds the contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,西方崛起了新领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a new leader rising in the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不怎么喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't like you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的交易 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know about your deal, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.95,0:00:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.65,0:00:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌握合约的那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon that holds it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也掌握了我的合约\N{\fnArial\fs30}She holds mine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.41,0:00:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她吗 - 她叫莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She? - Her name's Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.75,0:00:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是露比吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is Ruby, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.83,0:00:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个恶魔 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a demon, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.83,0:00:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要我们死 我们想要他们死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want us dead, we want them dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的刀能杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of blade can kill a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天的话 我会说没有这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, I'd have said there was no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄眼恶魔曾经对你有大计划啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yellow Eyes had some prettty big plans for you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.51,0:01:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you're special.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.67,0:01:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有超感幻象的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that ESP vision kind of way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.55,0:01:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那已经停止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that stuff's not happening anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.18,0:01:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是地狱之犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're seeing Hellhounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.43,0:01:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔斗牛犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demonic pit bulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.52,0:01:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没办法让我不下地狱 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way of saving me from the pit, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.15,0:01:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.11,0:01:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.23,0:01:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会想办法救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find a way to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.79,0:01:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.67,0:01:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你将变成的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you're gonna become.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.44,0:02:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到什么有用的了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dig up anything good?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.57,0:02:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.69,0:02:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比查到了 可算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Bobby has, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他查到了找到莉莉丝的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}A way to find Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.28,0:02:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩30小时了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with just, uh, 30 hours to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.25,0:02:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去趟提华纳吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we just make a TJ run, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:03:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,找点小妞 喝点啤酒 我们可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, some senoritas, cervezas. We could…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,西语「毛驴表演」怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Spanish for "donkey show"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.30,0:03:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if we do save you…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.34,0:03:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可别那么干 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- let's never do that. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道现在时间很紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're cutting it close, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're gonna get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.36,0:03:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管需要付出什么代价 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what it takes, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会下地狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.45,0:03:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你下地狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.70,0:03:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.93,0:03:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.65,0:04:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,便是所需要的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the whole kit and caboodle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.49,0:04:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字对了 仪式对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the right name, the right ritual,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.03,0:04:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么搞不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}ain't nothing you can't suss out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.53,0:04:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如找到莉莉丝所在的镇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the town Lilith's in?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.99,0:04:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 等我完事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, when I get done,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.83,0:04:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能知道街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll know the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.26,0:04:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第安纳州新哈莫尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}New Harmony, Indiana.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.47,0:04:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.60,0:04:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.98,0:04:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.98,0:04:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等一下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Holster it up there, Tex.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.31,0:04:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.98,0:04:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,「怎么了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What's the problem"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.90,0:04:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我从何说起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Where do I begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.57,0:04:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我们都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, first of all, we don't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.57,0:04:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝是否真掌握了我的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Lilith actually holds my deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.11,0:04:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是相信了贝拉的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going off of Bela's intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.49,0:04:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那贱人吐气时 吐出来的都是浑气\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when that bitch breathes, the air comes out crooked, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:04:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 即便我们能找到莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second, even if we could get to Lilith,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.29,0:04:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也没办法杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have no way to gank her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.41,0:05:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三 这个莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And third, isn't this the same Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.87,0:05:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是还想把你的大脑袋插在棍子上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that wants your giant head on a pike?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要我继续说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I continue?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真会搞气氛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't you just bringing down the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.17,0:05:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, it's a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.96,0:05:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 那我们要怎么办 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, so then, what are we supposed to do, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我要死了 不代表你也要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just cause I gotta die. Doesn't mean you have to. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.63,0:05:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们如果不能有计划地去 就别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either, we go in smart or we don't go in at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.34,0:05:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 如果是这样 那我有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Fine. If that's the case, I have the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.51,0:05:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do? - Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.30,0:05:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对能证实那就是莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}a sure-fire way to confirm it's Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能让我们拿到货真价实能杀恶魔的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a way to get us a bona fide, demon-killing Ginsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.39,0:05:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 萨姆 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Sam, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.48,0:05:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没得可争了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are so past arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.19,0:05:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我要召唤露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I am summoning Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.39,0:05:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你休想 我们的麻烦够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell you are, we've enough problems as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.73,0:05:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间 没选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we got no time and no choice either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 她是撒谎贱人的环球小姐 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, she is the Miss Universe of lying skanks, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟你说她能救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told you that she could save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.78,0:05:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她似乎对莉莉丝无所不知\N{\fnArial\fs30}She seems to know everything about Lilith…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但偏巧忘记说 哎呦\N{\fnArial\fs30}but forgot to mention, right,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝掌握着我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith owns my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 行 她是个撒谎精\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine, she's a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.83,0:05:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她还是有那把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still got that knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 说不定她就是莉莉丝的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean… - For all we know, she works for Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.33,0:05:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那再给我个别的选择 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, give me another option, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.41,0:05:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我还能怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, tell me what else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.33,0:05:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆是对的 - 不 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam's right. - No, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.34,0:05:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能再犯同样错误了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not gonna make the same mistakes all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.35,0:06:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想救我 另想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys wanna save me? Find something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where're you going, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.03,0:06:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,另想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}find something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.85,0:07:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话也能用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, phones work too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.27,0:07:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.81,0:07:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.48,0:07:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能移动得那么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you get around so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有超级碗杯喷气背包\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the Super Bowl jetpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.86,0:07:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.24,0:07:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you called?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.57,0:07:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得再给点信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna need a tiny bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}About Dean's deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.08,0:07:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝握着他的合同\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Lilith holds the contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.91,0:07:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.83,0:07:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你就没觉得那很重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what? You didn't think that was important?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们没准备好 - 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You weren't ready. - For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我早说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩蠢蛋会准备不充分地去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}you two yahoos would have just charged after her halfcocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.09,0:08:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝就会把你们漂亮脸蛋上的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lilith would have peeled the meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点点撕下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}from your pretty, pretty faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.01,0:08:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're ready now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.85,0:08:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want your knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.73,0:08:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.85,0:08:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are ready…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.23,0:08:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在时机也正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now's the time too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.73,0:08:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝正好没防备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith's guard's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在度假\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's on shore leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.87,0:08:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little R and R.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.99,0:08:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.78,0:08:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 你不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, you don't wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.83,0:08:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没弄丢我给你的巫术袋吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't lose those hex bags I gave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.41,0:08:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 那她就不会觉察到你们靠近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, then she won't sense that you're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把刀给我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you'll give us the knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.22,0:08:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你刚说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you just said…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.22,0:08:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想拿把杀猪刀就冲进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna charge in with one little pig-sticker?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.26,0:08:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是浪费大好时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a waste of a true-blue window.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.14,0:08:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像拿公文箱炸弹刺杀希特勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like hitting Hitler with that exploding briefcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别想了 - 好吧 那怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Forget it. - Okay, then how?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.19,0:08:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么救你哥哥 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how to save your brother, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.19,0:08:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.69,0:08:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对迪恩说了你做不到 你一直在对我撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told Dean you couldn't. You've been lying to me all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:09:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以把你的刀给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So just give me your damn knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.57,0:09:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有对你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the one that I've been lying to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.03,0:09:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你能救他吗 - 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you can save him? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.66,0:09:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.66,0:09:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有上帝赐予的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've got some God-given talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不是上帝赐予的 但你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not God-given, but you get the gist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵力吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that psychic crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.75,0:09:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄眼死后就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gone ever since Yellow Eyes died.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.30,0:09:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.84,0:09:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是休眠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dormant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.72,0:09:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且不光是幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not just visions either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为莉莉丝为什么那么怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think Lilith is so scared of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.93,0:09:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 她怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, she's scared of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.43,0:09:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanted,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.81,0:09:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不动一块肌肉就能灭了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could wipe her off the map without moving a muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.27,0:09:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.10,0:09:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你决定现在才跟我说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you decided to tell me this just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.44,0:09:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.94,0:09:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,操纵人心算是本职工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manipulative's kind of in the job description.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.49,0:09:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实就是 你绝不会考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fact is, is that you never would have considered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.95,0:09:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 除非你… - 足够绝望吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not until you were… - Desperate enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.25,0:09:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like being different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.25,0:09:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你讨厌迪恩有时看你的眼光\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hate the way Dean looks at you sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.75,0:09:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像你是个马戏团怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you're some sort of sideshow freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但忍着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But suck it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们要说得还很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we got a lot of ground to cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.92,0:10:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们得尽快开始 但我们能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we gotta do it fast, but we can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.76,0:10:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我是贱人 随你怎么恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, call me a bitch, hate me all you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.89,0:10:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我从未对你撒过谎 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I have never lied to you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.06,0:10:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,从未\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm telling you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.81,0:10:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以救你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can save your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以教你怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can show you how.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.03,0:10:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这样的人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的荡妇尤达大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our slutty little Yoda.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.11,0:10:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是那么讨人喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charming as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.53,0:10:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道萨姆不会听我话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I knew Sam wouldn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.79,0:10:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你别想教他什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not gonna teach him anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.79,0:10:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗 除非我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me? Over my dead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.59,0:10:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.25,0:10:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要把那把刀给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you are gonna do is give me that knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.63,0:10:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你要爬回你来的那个深渊里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you just go crawl back into whatever slop you came from,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别再来打扰我和我弟弟了 明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and never bother me and my brother again, are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.93,0:10:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟体内有个炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother is carrying a bomb inside of him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.01,0:10:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不用它就太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'd be stupid not to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.81,0:10:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 等一下 - 萨姆 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, look, just hold on… - Sam, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.02,0:10:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你瞎了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, what are you blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.10,0:10:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看不出这是诡计吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you see that this is a trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:10:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.94,0:11:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她希望你屈服于\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants you to give in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.90,0:11:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这恶魔灵力什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to this whole demonic, psychic whatever, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能希望你做她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell, she probably wants you to become her little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.94,0:11:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,反基督超级明星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antichrist superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.32,0:11:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要莉莉丝死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Lilith dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.82,0:11:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've told you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.53,0:11:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对哦 因为你曾是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yeah. Because you were human once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.83,0:11:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢猫咪和在海滩上漫步\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you like kittens and long walks on the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.29,0:11:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了向你证明自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I am so sick of proving myself to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.21,0:11:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想自救吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna save yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是唯一办法 你个没骨气的蠢混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how, you dumb, spineless dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.72,0:11:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你笑什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you grinning at?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.33,0:11:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,少了什么东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missing something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宰了你 你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.01,0:12:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.22,0:12:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.98,0:12:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就把我丢在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're just gonna leave me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.73,0:12:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是蠢到不想活了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're just too stupid to live, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.65,0:12:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活该下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserve hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望我也在那里 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wish I could be there, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我能闻到你骨头上的肉被烫掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could smell the flesh sizzle off your bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.54,0:12:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我能在那里听到你的尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could be there to hear you scream!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还希望你闭嘴呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wish you'd shut your pie hole,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不是总能得偿所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we don't always get what we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.23,0:13:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就让露比在下面发霉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just gonna let Ruby rot down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.36,0:13:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 如果…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what if…?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.53,0:13:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果露比是对的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if Ruby's right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.91,0:13:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能干掉莉莉丝呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I can take out Lilith?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit looking at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.41,0:13:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你要魔女嘉莉瞪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You gonna give her the Carrie stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝就炸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Lilith goes poof?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.00,0:13:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道露比什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what Ruby meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.79,0:13:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们该去问问她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe we should just go ask her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.79,0:13:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你想要刀 我帮你拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you wanted the knife, I got you the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 听我说一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, just listen to me for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次 莉莉丝弹个指响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time, Lilith snapped her fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让30个恶魔来围堵我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put 30 demons on our ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就一把小刀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all we got is one little knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你说的 我们如果没个好计划就不该去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, like you said, we go in smart or we don't go in at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这不够好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, this ain't smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.56,0:13:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有一个机会 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got one shot at this, Dean. Just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.98,0:13:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有什么万无一失的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if there's a sure-fire way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那或许我们该考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}then maybe we should just talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.40,0:13:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我们不能再犯同样的错误了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, we are not gonna make the same mistake all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.02,0:13:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话你说过了 但那什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that, but what does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.65,0:13:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还看不出规律吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see a pattern here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.44,0:13:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸的交易 我的 现在又是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's deal, my deal, now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.57,0:13:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我们中有一人陷入困境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, every time one of us is up the creek,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.41,0:14:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个就迫不及待地出卖灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}the other's begging to sell their soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.33,0:14:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all this is, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.12,0:14:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比是在把你往邪路上带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby's just jerking your chain down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚那是什么路 你清楚那通往何方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it's paved with, and you know where it's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.88,0:14:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you afraid is gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.30,0:14:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我啊 我能应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is me, I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it'll save you…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.76,0:14:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why even risk it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.98,0:14:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.52,0:14:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你也为我做了这样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you did the same thing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.90,0:14:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看结果如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look how that turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I'm saying…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.37,0:14:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我就是说你是我的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, all I'm saying is that you're my weak spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不是真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't mean that. We're…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:14:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些坏蛋也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those evil sons of bitches know it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.35,0:15:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们愿为彼此做的事 愿做到什么程度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what we'll do for each other, you know, how far we'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.43,0:15:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在以此对付我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're using it against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就不再照顾彼此了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what we just stop looking out for each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们不再牺牲自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we stop being martyrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.77,0:15:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不再替这些恶魔省事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, we stop spreading it for these demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.23,0:15:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿上刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take this knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.24,0:15:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我们的方式去对付莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we go after Lilith our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.78,0:15:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸教我们的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way Dad taught us to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.07,0:15:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we go down, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.24,0:15:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,也要英勇就义\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we go down swinging.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.92,0:15:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你刚刚绝对该配上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you totally should have been jamming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:39.80,Title,0,0,0,0,,《老虎之眼》做背乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Eye of the Tiger" right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这段话我练过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I totally rehearsed that speech too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.02,0:15:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第安纳州\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Indiana?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.27,0:15:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 莉莉丝在度假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, where Lilith is on shore leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.39,0:15:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.90,0:15:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.94,0:15:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔会做什么消遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does a demon do for fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帕特 - 汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pat. - Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.21,0:16:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你孙女怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that granddaughter of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,患病在家呢 小可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home sick, poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.84,0:16:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就近来到处传染的那病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darn bug that's going around now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.88,0:16:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你要替我和朱蒂好好抱抱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you give her a big old hug from me and Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,悠着点 汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her easy, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.05,0:16:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 帕特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, Pat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.78,0:16:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.12,0:16:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼上 跟雀斑玩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upstairs, playing with Freckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.37,0:16:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们只坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we just sit here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.29,0:16:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会听到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是她死就是我们亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her or us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.08,0:16:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她体内有什么别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something inside her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.51,0:17:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.46,0:17:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.55,0:17:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们刚刚说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you guys talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.64,0:17:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我们多爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just how much we love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.10,0:17:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的裙子怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to your dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.89,0:17:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,雀斑对我好凶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freckles was mean to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.73,0:17:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.94,0:17:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好啊 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nice, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.90,0:17:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你可以推我荡秋千吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, will you push me on the swing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.19,0:17:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sure, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.69,0:17:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不想先换衣服吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't you wanna change first?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.53,0:17:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不希望邻居看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you don't want the neighbors to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.99,0:17:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}all that blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好聪明 我爱你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so smart. I love you, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.67,0:17:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等过一阵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you think maybe after a while…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.80,0:17:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you think maybe you could…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.05,0:17:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}let us go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.14,0:17:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:17:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.31,0:17:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想待在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you wanna be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不爱我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.03,0:18:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sure, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.99,0:18:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都爱你 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all do, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.45,0:18:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都好爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别对我不好 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be mean to me, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像雀斑 还有那个叫啥的老婆子保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Freckles or what's-her-name, that mean old babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 傻瓜 我们去玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay, silly. Now let's go and play.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.22,0:18:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.11,0:18:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿到刀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.49,0:18:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们打算不带我去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you intend to use it without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看我像个能丢下的舞会舞伴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like a ditch-able prom date to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.53,0:18:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 鲍比 当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Bobby, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.74,0:18:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我和萨姆的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about me and Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this isn't your fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.71,0:18:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.83,0:19:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人不限于血脉 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family don't end with blood, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.97,0:19:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 你们需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.93,0:19:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比 - 你在带伤上阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby… - You're playing wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.47,0:19:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你出现多少幻觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, how many hallucinations have you had so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.02,0:19:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 你被地狱之犬追杀时就会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, that's what happens when you got Hellhounds on your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.48,0:19:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且因为我聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because I'm smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.12,0:19:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟着你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别每10分钟就停车撒尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be stopping to pee every 10 minutes either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.72,0:19:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.18,0:19:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if this doesn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.73,0:20:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这事不能如我们所愿 我要你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this doesn't go the way we want, I want you to know…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.23,0:20:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}"No" what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.85,0:20:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别眼泪汪汪地跟我道别 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna bust out the misty goodbye speech, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.15,0:20:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是我在世间的最后一天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if this is my last day on earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.61,0:20:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想搞得气氛尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not want it to be socially awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.91,0:20:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我想要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I do want?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.67,0:20:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦乔维 - 邦乔维偶尔也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bon Jovi? - Bon Jovi rocks on occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.05,0:20:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,*我走过这些街道*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*And I walk these streets, *
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.13,0:20:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,*背后背着吉他*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*A loaded six-string on my back*
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,*我不闹着玩*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*I play for keeps, *
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,*因为我可能有去无回*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*'cause I might not make it back*
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.68,0:20:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,*我走遍了各处*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*I've been everywhere, *
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.35,0:20:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- *耶* - *我站得直*\N{\fnArial\fs30}- *Yeah.* - *And I'm standing tall*
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.32,0:20:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,*我见过无数面庞*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*I've seen a million faces*
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.11,0:20:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,*我震撼了他们所有人*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*and I've rocked them all*
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.24,0:20:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,*因为我是个牛仔*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*'Cause I'm a cowboy, *
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.49,0:20:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,*我骑在钢马上*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*On a steel horse I ride*
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.79,0:21:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- *我被通缉* - *被通缉*\N{\fnArial\fs30}- *I'm wanted* - *Wanted*
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.29,0:21:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,*不论死活*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Dead or alive*
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.38,0:21:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,*不论死活*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Dead or alive*
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.59,0:21:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,*不论死活*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Dead or alive*
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.87,0:21:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,*不论死活*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Dead or alive*
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.18,0:21:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,*不论死活*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Dead or alive*
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.99,0:21:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要被叫停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting pulled over?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.91,0:21:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尾灯坏了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a busted taillight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.79,0:21:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我们又不急\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like we're in a hurry or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:21:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事吗 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem, officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.93,0:22:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,请出示驾照和行驶证\N{\fnArial\fs30}License and registration, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.31,0:22:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你坏了个尾灯吗 海嘉先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you realize you have a taillight out, Mr. Hagar?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.48,0:22:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.57,0:22:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想着要修一下呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've been meaning to take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.36,0:22:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.41,0:22:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.71,0:22:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩刚杀了个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean just killed a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.88,0:22:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.59,0:22:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.64,0:22:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看到它的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could see its face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.51,0:22:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那张脸下的真脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its real face under that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.61,0:22:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你现在能看到恶魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? Now you're seeing demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.11,0:23:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我近来看到了各种东西 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been seeing all kinds of things lately, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.57,0:23:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.03,0:23:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 这并不疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's not all that crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.95,0:23:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么不疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it not that crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.08,0:23:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还剩多久 五个多小时了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got? Just over five hours to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.83,0:23:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要穿过阴阳隔界了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're piercing the veil, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.58,0:23:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能瞥见B面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're glimpsing the B-side.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.71,0:23:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么新时代好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little less New Age-y, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.96,0:23:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快成地狱贱民了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're almost hell's bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.01,0:23:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你能看到其他地狱贱民\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can see hell's other bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.76,0:23:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还挺方便的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it'll actually come in pretty handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.30,0:23:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴我被诅咒的灵魂还能派上用场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm glad my doomed soul's good for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.35,0:23:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.85,0:23:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝可能在镇上到处安了恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith's probably got demons stashed all over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.39,0:23:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让他们奏响警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let them sound the alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.31,0:23:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她知道我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she knows we're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定出师未捷身先死\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're dead before we started.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.31,0:23:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这计划太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is a terrific plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.90,0:23:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很激动能参与其中 我们可以走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm excited to be a part of it. Can we go, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.87,0:23:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.87,0:23:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 生日快乐 - 生日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Happy birthday. - Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.58,0:23:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 每天都是我生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay, it's my birthday every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.09,0:24:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.13,0:24:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,又吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.76,0:24:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.93,0:24:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,爷爷 能问你件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa, can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.81,0:24:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 小糖豆 随便问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, jellybean, anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.31,0:24:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么企图向维普林先生求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you try to go to Mr. Weprin for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.69,0:24:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.69,0:24:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.77,0:24:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个大骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a big fat liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.19,0:24:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.99,0:24:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.15,0:24:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you two know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.62,0:24:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.42,0:24:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.92,0:24:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.13,0:24:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不爱我吗 - 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you don't love me? - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.84,0:24:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.09,0:24:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.76,0:24:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又在撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.59,0:24:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是坏老头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a mean old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.47,0:24:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.27,0:24:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.02,0:24:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我不喜欢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I like you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.15,0:24:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不许叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody scream, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.07,0:24:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,尖叫让我生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screaming makes me mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.08,0:25:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我可以再吃点冰淇淋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, can I have ice cream with mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.17,0:25:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.17,0:25:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 她的脸好丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, her face is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.84,0:25:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那我们走吧 我们在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then let's go. We're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.88,0:25:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.09,0:25:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.05,0:25:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等她把剩下的人都杀了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For her to kill the rest of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.14,0:25:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 如果我们不小心也要送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and us too, if we're not careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.10,0:25:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.64,0:25:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那个晚上9点还在工作的邮递员了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the real go-getter mailman on the clock at 9 p.m?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.31,0:25:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那边的罗杰斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mr. Rogers over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.98,0:25:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.06,0:25:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.27,0:25:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们干掉那些人 再偷溜进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine. We… We ninja past those guys, sneak in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.11,0:25:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢 把一个10岁小姑娘割喉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what, give a Colombian necktie to a ten-year-old girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.03,0:25:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得了 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Look, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.57,0:25:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道这很糟 - 还用你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know it's awful. - You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.78,0:25:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不光是救你 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't just about saving you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.20,0:25:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是救所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about saving everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.08,0:25:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她必须被阻止 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gotta be stopped, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.21,0:25:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.58,0:25:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,再读一遍 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read it again, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.17,0:26:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我都读26次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've read it 26 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.46,0:26:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,再读一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.51,0:26:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「很久很久以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Once upon a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.01,0:26:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在塞勒涅镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the town of Selene…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.51,0:26:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,住了个美丽的公主 柯丽奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}lived a beautiful princess named Cleo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.64,0:26:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但小镇当时被一只恶龙侵扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the town was plagued with an evil dragon…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.48,0:26:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,它要求血祭儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}that demanded the blood of the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.57,0:26:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主注定要被祭祀给\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the princess was doomed to be sacrificed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.03,0:26:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那黑暗可怕的恶龙「\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the dark and terrible dragon."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.68,0:27:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,请把我的刀还我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like my knife back, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.77,0:27:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则拧断你的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or your neck snaps like a chicken bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.81,0:27:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀不在他那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.89,0:27:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.19,0:27:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.36,0:27:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我的事能写本书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you don't know about me could fill a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.36,0:27:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.24,0:27:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.28,0:27:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前看不到 但你真丑爆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't see it before, but you are one ugly broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.50,0:27:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.75,0:28:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把刀给我 别伤到你自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}give me the knife before you hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.00,0:28:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一切结束再给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get it when this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.08,0:28:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's already over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.59,0:28:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了你救迪恩的办法 你拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you a way to save Dean, you shot me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.34,0:28:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.55,0:28:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.34,0:28:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你也一起死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not gonna let you die too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.63,0:28:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.01,0:28:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.68,0:28:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贱人 - 放马过来吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- bitch. - Hit me with your best shot, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.64,0:28:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.48,0:28:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍后再吵吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have your little catfight later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.07,0:28:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看来别想偷袭了 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So much for the element of surprise. - Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.65,0:28:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.70,0:28:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.49,0:28:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比在干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's taking Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.91,0:28:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.76,0:29:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得莉莉丝知道我们来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Lilith knows we're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.39,0:29:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.79,0:29:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来帮忙的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to help, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.83,0:29:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就把手放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna move my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.25,0:29:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们小声说话 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna talk nice and quiet. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.38,0:29:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你女儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, where is your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.38,0:29:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.01,0:29:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not her anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.13,0:29:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.97,0:29:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.47,0:29:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她卧室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In her bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.01,0:29:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.06,0:29:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你下楼 去地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to go downstairs to the basement,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.89,0:29:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上门 撒一道盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}put a line of salt at the door behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.56,0:29:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.39,0:29:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得带上我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.10,0:29:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等不起了 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, without your wife. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.37,0:31:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.33,0:31:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.38,0:31:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.88,0:31:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.72,0:31:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.39,0:31:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.56,0:31:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.55,0:31:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.52,0:31:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在女孩身体里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not in the girl anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.44,0:31:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.40,0:31:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.52,0:31:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈在呢 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy's here. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.91,0:32:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.70,0:32:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不管你听到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. No matter what you hear,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.71,0:32:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你丈夫 女儿都要待在地下室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and your husband and your daughter stay in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.00,0:32:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.92,0:32:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想说早告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hate to be a told-you-so.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.17,0:32:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 露比 她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Ruby, where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.55,0:32:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.01,0:32:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她能突破洒水器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, can she get past the sprinklers?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.05,0:32:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这种级别的 才不在乎圣水呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}At her pay grade, she ain't sweating the holy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.30,0:32:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你赢了 我需要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you win. What do I have to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.35,0:32:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思 - 救迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - To save Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.72,0:32:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.85,0:32:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.93,0:32:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut up for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.44,0:32:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 露比 - 我给过你机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ruby. - You had your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.85,0:32:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是打开个开关那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just flip a switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.19,0:32:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要时间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We needed time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.94,0:32:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定还有办法 肯定有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's gotta be something, there's gotta be some way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.53,0:32:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管什么我都做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.32,0:32:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 迪恩 我不能允许你下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't, Dean. I'm not gonna let you go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.40,0:32:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 你没别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Yes, you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.62,0:32:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.79,0:32:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.87,0:32:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this was all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.00,0:32:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.00,0:32:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你这么做 也救不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what you're doing is not gonna save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.63,0:33:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会害死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.67,0:33:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我要怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.39,0:33:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持斗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.52,0:33:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾好我的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of my wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.82,0:33:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 记住爸爸教你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, remember what Dad taught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.74,0:33:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.66,0:33:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住我教你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remember what I taught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.85,0:33:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.65,0:34:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不会希望我最恨的敌人遭受这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't wish this upon my worst enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.08,0:34:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.37,0:34:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.75,0:34:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.32,0:34:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我刀 或许我能打过它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the knife. Maybe I can fight it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.07,0:34:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.65,0:34:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那巫尘撑不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}That dust won't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.62,0:34:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.29,0:34:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.62,0:34:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 那不是露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, that's not Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.12,0:34:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.01,0:35:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在她体内多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been in her?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.68,0:35:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not long.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.80,0:35:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.35,0:35:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好成年 好漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all grown-up and pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.48,0:35:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where's Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.44,0:35:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很不乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a very bad girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.19,0:35:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我把她赶跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I sent her far, far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.53,0:35:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该看出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I should've seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.36,0:35:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们在我看来都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you all look alike to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.50,0:35:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.87,0:35:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就想见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've wanted to meet you for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.59,0:35:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的嘴唇好软\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lips are soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.81,0:35:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你抓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so you have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.43,0:35:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let my brother go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.31,0:36:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silly goose.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.85,0:36:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想讨价还价 你得有我想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a bargain, you have to have something that I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.44,0:36:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.32,0:36:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的大计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is this your big plan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.70,0:36:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我拖下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drag me to hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.41,0:36:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.45,0:36:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.83,0:36:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为贱人女王吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Become queen bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.95,0:36:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要回答狗食\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to answer to puppy chow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.59,0:36:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬死他 小子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sic him, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.55,0:36:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.26,0:36:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.02,0:36:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.27,0:36:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.40,0:36:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.28,0:36:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.28,0:36:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.36,0:36:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.16,0:36:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.91,0:36:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.28,0:37:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.57,0:37:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.62,0:37:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.32,0:38:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.49,0:38:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.83,0:38:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.62,0:38:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.97,0:38:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.76,0:38:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.56,0:38:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.27,0:38:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.32,0:38:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.07,0:39:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
